{"ticker":{"symbol":"019770.KQ","name":"서연탑메탈","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":3300.0,"change_pct":-0.0393013100436681,"market_cap":38444998656.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.019696969696969695,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":4480.0,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Parts","country":"South Korea","city":"Incheon","employees":null,"website":"https://www.topmetal.co.kr","business_summary":"Seoyon Topmetal Co., Ltd. produces and sells automobile body parts stamping tools, injection molds for interior parts, and excavator cabins in South Korea. The company offers various dies, including side outer, fender, door, hood, tail gate, roof, and trunk lid. It also offers under cover, bumper cover, lamp housing, cowl top cover, sill side, wheel guard, and other equipment. The company was formerly known as Top Metal Works Co., Ltd. Seoyon Topmetal Co., Ltd. was founded in 1987 and is headquartered in Incheon, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"서연탑메탈(주)는 한국에서 자동차 차체 부품 스탬핑 공구, 내장 부품용 사출 금형, 굴삭기 캐빈을 생산 및 판매하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 사이드 아우터, 펜더, 도어, 후드, 테일 게이트, 루프, 트렁크 리드 등 다양한 금형을 제공합니다. 또한 언더 커버, 범퍼 커버, 램프 하우징, 카울 탑 커버, 실 사이드, 휠 가드 및 기타 장비도 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Top Metal Works Co., Ltd.로 알려졌습니다. Seoyon Topmetal Co., Ltd.는 1987년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 인천에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"자동차 부품","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":164178182250.0,"operating_income":2807000910.0,"net_income":2792975400.0,"eps":240.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":173052825570.0,"operating_income":6949154790.0,"net_income":8472313850.0,"eps":727.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":182361573210.0,"operating_income":9257115140.0,"net_income":9379886080.0,"eps":805.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":207061838040.0,"operating_income":11911500990.0,"net_income":9298678230.0,"eps":798.0}],"price_history":[],"analyst"